<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in the San Francisco Bay Area</h1><p>Planning a kitchen remodel or new build in the Bay Area? Pinnacle Sales represents five premium cabinetry brands — Eclipse, Pronorm German Kitchens, Shiloh, Aspect, and Vistora Closets — sold through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
