<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<p>From San Francisco and Marin to the Peninsula — Palo Alto, Atherton, Los Altos — and the East Bay's Walnut Creek, Lafayette, and Orinda, the Bay Area leans clean and contemporary, with strong demand for frameless and European cabinetry.</p>
<h2 id="bay-area-kitchen-showrooms">Bay Area Kitchen Showrooms</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across the Bay Area. Tell us about your project and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="best-cabinet-lines-for-bay-area-kitchens">Best Cabinet Lines for Bay Area Kitchens</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access — a natural fit for the Bay Area's contemporary aesthetic.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end Peninsula, Marin, and East Bay homes.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and <a href="/playbook/modern-inset">inset</a> for transitional and craftsman remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for ADUs and multi-unit projects.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="bay-area-kitchen-design-trends">Bay Area Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Bay Area kitchens favor clean, contemporary design — flat-panel and slab fronts, warm woods against white and gray, and integrated, minimalist detailing. The tech-driven Peninsula and Silicon Valley markets push toward seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens, while Marin, the East Bay, and San Francisco's many period homes balance modern function with transitional warmth.</p>
